"python3 -c \"\nimport os\nd = '/var/mobile/Containers/Data/Application/36B9F6AF-4B0A-4C57-A3E3-846217E6D0BD/Documents/fastshell/projects/Test1/ppbc_丁香罗勒'\nfor f in sorted(os.listdir(d)):\n    p = os.path.join(d, f)\n    with open(p, 'rb') as fh:\n        data = fh.read()\n    is_jpeg = data[:2] == b'\\xff\\xd8'\n    is_png = data[:4] == b'\\x89PNG'\n    is_jfif = b'JFIF' in data[:30]\n    is_ihdr = b'IHDR' in data[:30]\n    print(f'{f}: jpeg={is_jpeg} png={is_png} jfif={is_jfif} ihdr={is_ihdr} size={len(data)}')\n\""
"# The list21 page rendered with infinite scroll. We can find the photo detail URLs by examining the HTML\n# Looking at the page: images are loaded into .item divs, and they have <a href=\"/tu/{photoid}\"> links\n# The thumbnail URLs we have are from getspphotolist.ashx but they're not the photo IDs.\n# The photo IDs are typically the timestamps in the URL.\n\n# Let me check the PPBC info page to find photo detail URLs\ncurl -sL \"http://ppbc.iplant.cn/list21?keyword=Ocimum+gratissimum\" -A \"Mozilla/5.0\" 2>/dev/null > /tmp/ppbc_kw.html\ngrep -oE \"/tu/[0-9]+|img[0-9]?\\.iplant\\.cn[^\\\"']+\" /tmp/ppbc_kw.html | head -30"
"# The list21 page only has the placeholder and AJAX loads the photo links. The 4 thumbnail URLs we got from the API don't directly map to /tu/{id} pages. \n# Let me check the page that PPBC uses for photo detail. Try the spid page:\ncurl -sL \"http://ppbc.iplant.cn/sp/29482\" -A \"Mozilla/5.0\" 2>/dev/null > /tmp/ppbc_sp.html\ngrep -oE \"tu/[0-9]+|/photo/[0-9]+|/img[0-9]?/[0-9A-Za-z._]+|photo[Ii]d|photoid\" /tmp/ppbc_sp.html | head -20\necho \"===\"\n# Check by visiting the URL pattern of any photo page\ncurl -sL \"http://ppbc.iplant.cn/tu/1\" -A \"Mozilla/5.0\" -w \"HTTP=%{http_code} size=%{size_download}\\n\" 2>/dev/null | head -c 200"
