"# The tu page doesn't exist (redirects to home). The decimal ID interpretation is wrong.\n# The PPBC photo URL pattern uses a different ID. Looking at the comment \"https://ppbc.iplant.cn/tu/2087130\"\n# Let me find the actual photo IDs by examining one of the photo detail URLs\n\n# Let me check the search results page for 丁香罗勒 - it should list the photos with IDs\n# The classspsearch endpoint returns species info, not photos. \n# But getserachinfo21.ashx returns photo search results for /list21\n\ncurl -sL \"http://ppbc.iplant.cn/ashx/getserachinfo21.ashx?keyword=Ocimum+gratissimum\" -A \"Mozilla/5.0\" -o /tmp/ppbc_search21.json -w \"HTTP=%{http_code} size=%{size_download}\\n\"\necho \"===\"\nhead -c 5000 /tmp/ppbc_search21.json"
